!!! The Gauges

```
\procedure ~aperture(at) {{{ [<at>!is[blank]addprefix[aperture="]addsuffix["]] }}}
\procedure ~ooda-ha(at) {{{ [<at>!is[blank]addprefix[ooda-ha="]addsuffix["]] }}}
