/home/joshu/Synthetic-Dream-Machine/bags/lares/ha.ka.ba/lares/docs/pono/controller-handoff.mem-47-* ''The plugin bundle and genesis move only by the controller's word.'' A lane that changes `packages/lararium-tw5/` source or tiddlers rebuilds the bundle in the same commit and declares the gap in `genesis/unbaked.json`; one labelled `GENESIS RE-BAKE` folds every declared row.
